        <h2>Bridging User Needs and Business Goals</h2>

        <p>
          Neurofit aimed to improve its marketing website's
          <strong>conversion performance</strong> by increasing
          free trial sign-ups and supporting paid conversions.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our challenge was to understand how visitors perceived
          its offerings, explored the website, and decided whether
          to take the next step — then translate research insights
          into a clearer, more engaging, and conversion-focused experience.
        </p>

        <strong>Project Scope</strong>
        <p>

There are three user groups: Clinicians, Insurers & TPAs, and Higher Education as audience groups of Neurofit's marketing website.
</p>
<p>
In alignment with the client, our design work prioritized Clinicians and Insurers & TPAs. The project focused on website information architecture, content strategy, responsive UI, and a reusable design system; logo redesign was outside the agreed scope.</p>

