          01 / CONTENT & AUDIENCE ENGAGEMENT
        </span>

        <h5>Signals of Professional Information Needs</h5>

        <p>
          Engagement across clinician, FAQ, company information,
          and outcomes-related content suggested that visitors
          may seek clarity and supporting evidence before
          taking action. Insurer-focused content showed
          comparatively limited activity.
        </p>

        <div class="nf-ga4-implication">
          <strong>Design Opportunity</strong>
          <p>
            Surface credible evidence and audience-relevant
            information while providing clearer pathways
            toward demos and free sign-up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Finding 02 -->
      <div class="nf-ga4-finding">
