          Existing GA4 tracking could not reliably distinguish
          CTA interactions or measure completed registrations
          through the externally hosted sign-up form.
        </p>

        <div class="nf-ga4-implication">
          <strong>My Recommendation</strong>
          <p>
            Implement differentiated CTA events, reliable
            sign-up completion tracking, and a measurement
            framework for future redesign evaluation.
