          <p>
            Interview participants needed clearer explanations
            of Neurofit's features, supported applications,
            and practical use within professional workflows.
            The website audit also identified weaknesses in
            the value proposition and content hierarchy.
          </p>

          <p class="nf-finding-implication">
            <strong>Design Implication</strong><br>
            Clarify Neurofit's value upfront through concise messaging and practical workflow examples.
          </p>
