      <p class="results-description">I helped shape the research framework, coordinated research quality and synthesis, and translated findings into design direction. As UI Technical Art Director, I developed the component library and implementation specifications and designed key high-fidelity screens, including the homepage and insurers/TPAs overview. I also facilitated recurring discussions with Neurofit's CEO to keep design decisions aligned with project priorities.</p>
    </div></div></div>
    <div class="results-block reflection-block"><div class="row"><div class="col-lg-9">
      <span class="results-number">03</span><h3 class="results-title">Reflection — Leading Through Complexity</h3>
      <p class="reflection-statement">Effective design leadership means building the structure that helps a team deliver—not personally owning every task.</p>
      <p class="reflection-text">Working across research, art direction, interface design, and stakeholder communication strengthened my ability to connect insights with scalable solutions. It also showed me the importance of establishing clear ownership, shared quality standards, and regular team alignment earlier in a project.</p>
      <p class="reflection-text">This project produced design and handoff deliverables, not verified post-launch outcomes. Future work should include representative usability testing and measurement after implementation.</p>
